    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at a several places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Southern, Uva, Eastern and North-central provinces and in Kurunegala and Mullaitivu districts after 1.00 p.m. Fairly heavy falls above 50 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
