    ],
    "text": "\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82 \u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dc0 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0dc3 \u0db8\u0dcf \u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d85\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba GENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR SRI LANKA \u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dba\u0dcf \u0db8\u0db0\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dc4\u0dda, \u0d85\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d82\u0dc1\u0dba \u0db8\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd2 Issued by Forecasting Division, National Meteorological Centre",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      84.62,
      186.38,
      507.65,
      198.38
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR SEA AREAS AROUND THE ISLAND DURING NEXT 24 HOURS",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      190.25,
      203.42,
      402.14,
      215.9
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 01 November 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      228.38,
      528.56,
      278.42
    ],
    "text": "The Deep Depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal has intensified into a Cyclone and named as \u2018MURASU\u2019. The system was located near latitude 12.1\u00b0N and longitude 85.3\u00b0E at 11.30 a.m. on 01st November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      297.29,
      529.13,
      359.81
    ],
    "text": "\u2018Cyclone Murasu\u2019 is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify further into a Severe Cyclonic Storm over West-central Bay of Bengal around 2nd November morning. Thereafter it is very likely to move northwestwards and cross Andhra Pradesh coast to India as a Severe Cyclonic Storm during midnight of 2nd to early hours of 3rd November, 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      378.65,
      529.1,
      424.37
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-15N and 80E-90E until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      443.21,
      529.11,
      472.03
    ],
    "text": "Furthermore, naval and fishing communities are advised not to venture into the deep-sea areas extending from Mannar to Trincomalee via Kankasanthurai until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      490.87,
      528.54,
      536.83
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard. Condition of Rain:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      546.03,
      513.41,
      559.99
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the sea areas around the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      571.15,
      529.02,
      617.11
    ],
    "text": "Winds: Winds will be South-westerly or Southerly in the sea areas around the island. Wind speed will be (25-35) kmph.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      620.41,
      124.29,
      641.23
    ],
    "text": "State of Sea:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      649.54,
      307.32,
      661.54
    ],
    "text": "The sea areas around the island will be moderate.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      665.5,
      528.78,
      702.1
    ],
    "text": "Temporarily strong gusty winds (60-70 kmph) and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  }
